                                "sense_id": "2a7099f5-849d-3532-bc14-1d6bc2079329",
                                "text": "It’s hard to say the precise moment when CBD, the voguish cannabis derivative, went from being a fidget spinner alternative for stoners to a mainstream panacea.",
                                "translation": "很难说大麻二酚这种时髦的大麻衍生物究竟是从什么时候开始，从瘾君子的指尖陀螺替代品变成了主流的万灵药。"
                            },
                            {
