                                "sense_id": "2a7099f5-849d-3532-bc14-1d6bc2079329",
                                "text": "“It is a kind of a new snake oil in the sense that there are a lot of claims and not so much evidence,” said Dustin Lee, an assistant professor in psychiatry and behavioral sciences at Johns Hopkins University who is planning a human trial of CBD for use in quitting smoking.",
